Bind Npc 24204 Zone 1 for karus priest
Bind Npc 14204 Zone 2 for elmorad priest
Quest 357 "74Lv skill"
    Journal for karus "I've decided to undergo the test to learn the hidden skills of [Priest] Minerva."
    Journal for elmorad "I've decided to undergo the test to learn the hidden skills of [Priest] Minerva."
    Collect 9 of 810369000

Requires player level >= 74

Rewards none

On offer
    Say "Priests save the world in the name of the gods. You are qualified to undergo the final training of the priesthood."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "To train the [Round Insensibility] skill, you will need 9 [Spell Stone Powder]. Are you ready for this?"

On in_progress
    Say "To receive the [Round Insensibility] skill, you need 9 [Spell Stone Powder]."

On ready
    Say "Master, you have collected all items needed to be conferred the  Round Insensibility skill. Hurry back to [Priest] Minerva."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You now possess the Round Insensibility skill. I trust you will continue to work toward saving the world."
